# LANTERN kit — QML component kit (docs/design/qml_kit_forge/kit_spec_v1.md).
# Directory-import qmldir: because this file exists, the implicit same-directory
# import exposes ONLY the types listed here, so every public kit type must be
# listed. FrostBake.qml / FrostCrop.qml are deliberately NOT listed: they are
# internal mechanisms loaded by URL through gated Loaders (never resolved as
# types), so the frost machinery (QtQuick.Effects / QtQuick.Shapes imports)
# is only ever parsed when a SCENE-tier ground actually activates it.
singleton KitEnv 1.0 KitEnv.qml
singleton KitAssets 1.0 KitAssets.qml
Surface 1.0 Surface.qml
LivingGround 1.0 LivingGround.qml
FocusRing 1.0 FocusRing.qml
